  "houses_kendra_value": "Kendra Houses",
  "houses_kendra_desc": "Kendra houses (1, 4, 7, 10) are the angular or quadrant houses. They form the pillars of the horoscope and are considered the most powerful houses for planetary placement.",
  "houses_kendra_significance": "Planets in Kendra houses gain strength and their results become prominent in life. Benefics here protect and promote, while malefics can cause significant challenges.",
  "houses_kendra_point1": "1st House - Self, personality, physical body",
  "houses_kendra_point2": "4th House - Home, mother, emotional peace",
  "houses_kendra_point3": "7th House - Marriage, partnerships, others",
  "houses_kendra_point4": "10th House - Career, status, public life",
  "houses_kendra_point5": "Also called Vishnu Sthanas (seats of Vishnu)",

  "houses_trikona_value": "Trikona Houses",
  "houses_trikona_desc": "Trikona houses (1, 5, 9) are the trinal houses forming a triangle with the Ascendant. They are the most auspicious houses, representing dharma (purpose) and good fortune.",
  "houses_trikona_significance": "Lords of Trikona houses become yogakarakas (auspicious) regardless of their natural nature. Planets here bring blessings, wisdom, and spiritual growth.",
  "houses_trikona_point1": "1st House - Self and personality (also Kendra)",
  "houses_trikona_point2": "5th House - Creativity, children, intelligence",
  "houses_trikona_point3": "9th House - Fortune, dharma, higher learning",
  "houses_trikona_point4": "Also called Lakshmi Sthanas (seats of Lakshmi)",
  "houses_trikona_point5": "Best houses for benefic planets",

  "houses_dusthana_value": "Dusthana Houses",
  "houses_dusthana_desc": "Dusthana houses (6, 8, 12) are considered malefic or challenging houses. They represent difficulties, obstacles, and areas requiring transformation.",
  "houses_dusthana_significance": "While often feared, these houses are essential for growth. They show where we face challenges that ultimately lead to strength, wisdom, and spiritual evolution.",
  "houses_dusthana_point1": "6th House - Enemies, diseases, debts, service",
  "houses_dusthana_point2": "8th House - Transformation, death, occult, inheritance",
  "houses_dusthana_point3": "12th House - Losses, expenses, liberation, foreign",
  "houses_dusthana_point4": "Malefics do well here (Vipreet Raja Yoga potential)",
  "houses_dusthana_point5": "Lords of these houses can cause difficulties",

  "houses_upachaya_value": "Upachaya Houses",
  "houses_upachaya_desc": "Upachaya houses (3, 6, 10, 11) are growth houses where results improve over time. Malefic planets actually do well here, providing drive and competitive edge.",
  "houses_upachaya_significance": "These houses show areas where effort leads to improvement. Unlike other houses, the challenges here decrease with age and experience.",
  "houses_upachaya_point1": "3rd House - Courage, siblings, communication",
  "houses_upachaya_point2": "6th House - Enemies, health issues, competition",
  "houses_upachaya_point3": "10th House - Career, public standing, authority",
  "houses_upachaya_point4": "11th House - Gains, friends, aspirations",
  "houses_upachaya_point5": "Mars, Saturn, Rahu excel in Upachaya houses",

  "houses_maraka_value": "Maraka Houses",
  "houses_maraka_desc": "Maraka houses (2, 7) are death-inflicting houses in Vedic astrology. Their lords can cause health issues or endings during their planetary periods.",
  "houses_maraka_significance": "The 2nd and 7th houses are 12th from the 3rd and 8th houses respectively, making them potential terminators of longevity factors.",
  "houses_maraka_point1": "2nd House - Family, wealth, food, death",
  "houses_maraka_point2": "7th House - Spouse, partnerships, death",
  "houses_maraka_point3": "Maraka planets can cause illness in their periods",
  "houses_maraka_point4": "2nd is stronger Maraka than 7th",
  "houses_maraka_point5": "Effects modified by overall chart strength",

